                "title": "Task_02: Real Interview Task Including Docker",
                "content": "Open this website from Docker image \u2192 `gprestes/the-internet`\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-10-05 at 09.35.26.png](https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/secure.notion-static.com/fd1260a6-5b34-449c-aa61-a7ab537a9a4d/Screen_Shot_2022-10-05_at_09.35.26.png)\n\n    **Steps:**\n\n    1. Open Docker hub\n    2. Search for `gprestes/the-internet`\n    3. Click firsts result\n\n        ![Screen Shot 2022-10-05 at 09.37.58.png](https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/secure.notion-static.com/cf159410-25b7-4803-9ec2-daf282905884/Screen_Shot_2022-10-05_at_09.37.58.png)\n\n    4. Read Overview\n\n        ![Screen Shot 2022-10-05 at 09.38.29.png](https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/secure.notion-static.com/2c8e08e7-dcb6-4dc0-b891-397d72576b19/Screen_Shot_2022-10-05_at_09.38.29.png)\n\n    5. Open Terminal/CLI\n    6. Install with docker command\n\n        `docker pull gprestes/the-internet`\n\n    7. Run this command:\u00a0`docker run -d -p 7080:5000 gprestes/the-internet`\n    8. Open browser and type here `localhost:8080`\n\n        ![Screen Shot 2022-10-05 at 09.40.44.png](https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/secure.notion-static.com/202762cd-0c95-469c-8a2b-ee313b87d267/Screen_Shot_2022-10-05_at_09.40.44.png)\n\n\n    [**localhost:7080](http://localhost:7080) will open application itself into your local**\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-10-07 at 05.55.26.png](https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/secure.notion-static.com/b4450105-78e4-4b4a-9f07-74e9c777b0d5/Screen_Shot_2022-10-07_at_05.55.26.png)"
