                "title": "Pre - Conditions and Materials",
                "content": "1. **We will use EC2 instance(JENKINS SERVER) from AWS that you already created it from AMI**\n    1. Jenkins                     \u2192 8081\n    2. Oracle Database     \u2192 1521\n    3. Spartan App.           \u2192 8000\n    4. Spartan with Auth.  \u2192 7000\n    5. HR ORDS                 \u2192 1000\n2. **Create Project From Intellij**\n\n     **VIDEO** :\n\n    [Project_Creation_Last.mp4](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/e5b50451-a931-43bc-aefe-27c0cf5e0f63/Project_Creation_Last.mp4)\n\n    **STEP 1 :**\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.39.21.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/71aebf0d-faca-4258-9526-d5983b7b2bad/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.39.21.png)\n\n    **STEP** 2 :\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.41.10.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/4f2ce18a-ffef-4585-a347-df9356219b24/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.41.10.png)\n\n3. **Getting IP From EC2**\n\n\n    <aside>\n    \u26a0\ufe0f You will need  **`PUBLIC IP`** address from **`EC2` `JENKINS SERVER`** machine to connect  **`ORACLE Database`**\n\n    </aside>\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2021-11-04 at 12.10.39.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/779d3f4f-d04f-4a43-8fbd-d35e987481ef/Screen_Shot_2021-11-04_at_12.10.39.png)\n\n4. **Making Connection**\n\n    \u2757\u2757\u2757\u2757.   UserName and Password \u2192 **hr**   \u2757\u2757\u2757\u2757\u2757\n\n    **STEP 1 :**\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.21.07.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/7c884722-b4f3-4b94-81e5-ccc62bcf55f8/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.21.07.png)\n\n    <aside>\n    \u26a0\ufe0f **IF YOU DON\u2019T HAVE A DATABASE TAB**\n\n     1.  Make sure you are using Ultimate Edition Intellij . If it is not Ultimate there is a video in Java Module to install the Ultimate version.\n\n    1. If it is Ultimate and still you can\u2019t see it, follow the steps to get Database Tab\n\n        ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.49.09.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/6bddb5c4-08d2-4bd1-a99c-df71c21f27b7/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.49.09.png)\n\n    </aside>\n\n    **STEP 2 :**\n\n    \u2014> **USE JENKINS SERVER IP**  \u2014> JENKINS SERVER need to be UP and RUNNING.\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.25.08.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/865542ef-018b-4f2c-a2be-c1daac4a0a43/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.25.08.png)\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 10.02.51.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/85e8d3ae-1698-4981-ab27-25e9715622c7/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_10.02.51.png)\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.51.42.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/56f34348-0a7e-405f-8075-e60e92c574ba/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.51.42.png)\n\n    ![Screen Shot 2022-06-29 at 06.36.38.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/d42144ba-0ebf-4148-86d0-94f93cc332ff/Screen_Shot_2022-06-29_at_06.36.38.png)\n\n    <aside>\n    \u26a0\ufe0f **IF YOU CAN\u2019T SEE TABLES**\n\n     1.  Right Click over HR\n\n    1. Refresh\n\n        ![Screen Shot 2022-11-13 at 11.09.05.png](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/82288186-d037-4e16-a284-f8d7ac1831cd/Screen_Shot_2022-11-13_at_11.09.05.png)\n\n    </aside>\n\n5. How To Open SQL Files in Intellij\n\n    [SQL Files.mp4](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/eb9d9138-0a1d-4f9a-b4b7-138f10dd9ee8/SQL_Files.mp4)\n\n    <aside>\n    \u26a0\ufe0f **IF YOU DON\u2019T HAVE RUN BUTTON**\n\n     1.  Move your cursor over query\n\n    - **MAC USERS** \u2192 CMD+ENTER\n    - **WIN USERS** \u2192CTRL+ENTER\n    </aside>\n\n\n### **HR SCHEMA**\n\n![hrschema.gif](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/225dd17d-3925-410b-a543-07bd71c78cf1/ed84cd1f-ae28-4454-9800-f4fe8497f3c3/hrschema.gif)\n\n---"
